Package: tattlr
Title: Right-Click Feedback and Bug Reports for 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kike", "Delgado", email = "edelgado94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds a right-click "Send feedback / Report bug" menu to any
    'shiny' app when enabled through an option or environment variable. The
    report captures the shiny context (clicked element, module namespace,
    active tabs, input values, outputs in error, console errors) and is
    written as a Markdown file with a reproducible input list, optionally
    emailed, or passed to a custom handler.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    htmltools,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    emayili,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
